      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The video of the Impostor mark and preview being there, and then disappearing.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/lXOPVzo71gQ\n\n- All the avatars I used in the video are uploaded by me and have an impostors generated.\n\n- I start the game wearing \"Nawiko Good (Shorts)\". Impostors preview already missing.\n\n- I demonstrate that my other avatars still have Impostors preview and mark.\n\n- I change into \"Kikyo Crop Hoodie\", rejoin the world, and demonstrate that Impostors preview and mark are now missing for this avatar. They're still missing for the previous avatar as well.\n\n- I repeat these steps with \"Kikyo Casual Paka\" and \"Nawiko Good (Pants)\" with the same result: preview and mark are no longer visible for those avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
