  "details": "Hello,\n\nAccording to the Impostors documentation: \"You should notice that the \"Features\" of the avatar now includes \"Impostor\", except that unfortunately I don't have the feature indicated on VRChat.\n\nI've always had this problem: the day the Impostors came out, I created them on the site. Although the site told me that the Impostors were OK, VRChat wouldn't tell me.\n\nToday, I re-uploaded the same avatar, this time with a new ID, also on PC and Quest, and I have the same problem... even though people can see the Impostors.\n\nThank you,\n\nLusiiky",
